(Northwind Labs Employee Handbook) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Northwind Labs is a fictional software company used to test Shema AI. Everything in this) Tj T*
(handbook is invented for demonstration purposes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
( Working hours) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Our standard working week is 40 hours, from Monday to Friday. Core hours are 10:00 to 16:00,) Tj T*
(when everyone should be reachable. Outside core hours you can choose when to start and finish,) Tj T*
(as long as your team knows your schedule.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Overtime must be approved in advance by your manager. Approved overtime is compensated with) Tj T*
(time off at a rate of one and a half hours for every extra hour worked. Time off from overtime) Tj T*
(must be used within three months.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
