() Tj T*
(Each employee has a yearly learning budget of 40,000 rupees for courses, books and conferences.) Tj T*
(Requests above 15,000 rupees need approval from your manager. If you leave the company within) Tj T*
(one year of a course paid for by Northwind Labs, you may have to repay part of the cost.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every Friday afternoon from 15:00 is reserved for learning time. You can use it for online) Tj T*
(courses, reading, or internal knowledge-sharing sessions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
( IT and security) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Passwords must be at least 12 characters long and are managed with the company password) Tj T*
(manager. Two-factor authentication is mandatory for email, chat and code repositories.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Never share your login details with anyone, including the IT team. The IT team will never ask) Tj T*
(for your password.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Lost or stolen laptops must be reported to the IT help desk within one hour, so the device can) Tj T*
(be locked remotely. Company data may only be stored on company devices and approved cloud) Tj T*
(services.) Tj T*
